# What a browser does with a click on a link and a submit of a form

## Component App
State:
    Let n be 0.
Actions:
    To note:
        Set n to n + 1.
View:
    <main>
      <a id="plain" href="/somewhere">go</a>
      <a id="kept" href="/nowhere" on-click.prevent={note}>stay</a>
      <form id="search" action="/search"><input name="q" value="milk tea"></form>
      <p id="n">{n}</p>
    </main>

## Test: a link is followed and a prevented one is not
    Mount App.
    Click "#kept".
    Expect that the URL is equal to "/".
    Expect that the text of "#n" is equal to "1".
    Click "#plain".
    Expect that the URL is equal to "/somewhere".

## Test: a form nothing prevents submits itself
    Mount App.
    Submit "#search".
    Expect that the URL is equal to "/search?q=milk+tea".
